    <itunes:duration>01:02:26</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/60f8fa6b6aab9e07d715e5c4/Fo6nAJGkYE7waHgm73xyuWHDGkhV.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>书本x《默杀》柯汶利∶亲历校园霸凌后，我决定不再沉默</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66a9f03bd224ef2c37702389</link>
